{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/696425-tale-of-victor-frankenstein","id":696425,"title":"Tale of Victor Frankenstein","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-10T13:11:06-07:00","id":696425,"title":"Tale of Victor Frankenstein","content":"So this only historical tale of Linage Demiurge has always interested me and make me obsessed with <b>Promethean</b> in the first place.<br /> <br /> <b>I have a question how this myth is different from real world version in game world - what elements are changed and assumed? </b>Will <i>Year Without Summer</i> Dark Era dwell in this subject more?<br /> <br /> Also, I would gladly hear about your favorite and most <b>Promethean</b> appropriate variants of it. Myself, I love Kenneth Branagh's <i>Frakenstein</i> version - De Niro as Monster is truly taking me by the heart and showing perfectly changing of Refinements, from Aurum, by Stannum, to Copprum. Trailer below...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GFaY7r73BIs\" data-code=\"GFaY7r73BIs\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/GFaY7r73BIs/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> I ask this, as new version of our beloved tale will be reimagined and shown in new movie. I even think here is shown Demiurges tries in first in creating Pandoran, before proper Monster...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7p